# ─── 模型权重：体积 30 GiB+，且受各自上游许可约束 ───────────────────────────
# Model weights: 30 GiB+, and governed by their own upstream licences.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.sft
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx

# ─── 归档包与安装程序：不发布第三方二进制 ───────────────────────────────────
# Archives and installers: do not publish third-party binaries.
*.7z
*.zip
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.exe
*.msi
*.whl

# ─── 日志与运行时产物 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
*.log.err
_output/
output/
temp/
tmp/

# ─── 凭据与环境文件：绝不入库 ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials and environment files: never commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
credentials*
*credential*
secrets*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
.netrc
_netrc
.npmrc
.nuget/
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*_token*
*cookie*

# ─── 工具与依赖 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/

# ─── 本仓库脚本运行时生成的本地状态 ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Local state written by this repo's own scripts.
pagefile-backup.json
qwen-fw-test.txt

# ─── Windows / macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ─── 本仓库脚本运行时会生成的本地目录（不应入库） ───────────────────────────
# Local directories produced when this repo's scripts run - never commit these.
_evidence/
ComfyUI_windows_portable/
uploaded/
reference-images/
*.manifest.jsonpagefile-backup-*.json
